  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Smith Fragrances is starting its journey into selling outstanding fragrances that are influenced by popular scents for an affordable price.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: The initial product is Vanilla Grove. This is a sweet, citrus fragrance that is influenced by Parfums de Marly's Layton.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): An affordable, sweet, citrus fragrance without the highest boutique prices.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Upon the finalization of a sale, 15% of the final sale price will be allocated to the affiliate who is credited with the sale. Allocated payment will be distributed between 3 and 5 days after funds clear into business account.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Payment will be given in PayPal form to the affiliate as primary offering. Other payment options, such as Bank Transfers or Cashier's Cheques, may be discussed on a case by case basis with communication between affiliate and business</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information: For more information, please contact smithfragrances@gmail.com</p>\r\n</div>",
